# Only what the Maven build needs goes into the build context: everything is left out first,
# then the build files and the modules are let back in.
*

!.mvn/
!mvnw
!pom.xml
!notification-events/
!notification-api/
!delivery-worker/
# Not built into the images, but Maven reads the pom of every module of the build.
!end-to-end-tests/

**/target/
